 "finding": "Observed: the 029 overruns did not reproduce standalone (replay query max 8.55, 8.12, 4.09 s vs 15.33, 12.27, 15.14 s in the 8-worker study); the region build was <= 0.05 s per query; the longest single chunk was 1.16 s (20000 conflicts, 3.6M propagations). Inferred: under 8-worker contention a chunk sized only by conflicts (up to 20000, grown after fast chunks and blind to the cap time left) can run several seconds past the cap; the unchecked build is not the main cause. S5 design consequence: size every chunk by a propagation budget from the measured propagation rate and the cap time left (plus the conflict chunk), stop at a margin before the cap, and guard the build by its estimated time."
